/**
 * English -> hi / gu / as / bn for every phrase the driver app shows.
 *
 * The English is the key (see tx.ts). A missing entry renders the English -
 * visibly, never a blank or a code. Order: hi (Hindi), gu (Gujarati),
 * as (Assamese), bn (Bengali).
 *
 * REVIEW STATUS: drafted by the team, NOT reviewed by native speakers. Place
 * names, registrations, route codes, units and numbers are never translated.
 */

